{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismiss"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismiss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this environment value to get the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},{"type":"text","text":" instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the current "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment"},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to perform the dismissal. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method that Swift calls when you call the instance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can create a button that calls the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct SheetContents: View {","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Done\") {","            dismiss()","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you present the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SheetContents"},{"type":"text","text":" view in a sheet, the user can dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sheet by tapping or clicking the sheet’s button:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            SheetContents()","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Be sure that you define the action in the appropriate environment."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, don’t reorganize the "},{"code":"DetailView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the example above"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that it creates the "},{"code":"dismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property and calls it from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"View\/sheet(item:onDismiss:content:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier’s "},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closure:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss \/\/ Applies to DetailView.","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            Button(\"Done\") {","                dismiss() \/\/ Fails to dismiss the sheet.","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you do this, the sheet fails to dismiss because the action applies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the environment where you declared it, which is that of the detail"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, rather than the sheet. In fact, if you’ve presented the detail"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view in a "},{"code":"NavigationView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the dismissal pops the detail view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the navigation stack.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dismiss action has no effect on a view that isn’t currently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented. If you need to query whether OpenSwiftUI is currently presenting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a view, read the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues\/isPresented"},{"type":"text","text":" environment value."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismiss"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","text":"DismissAction"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"dismiss","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV7dismissAA13DismissActionVvp"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that dismisses the current presentation."}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentValues"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues"},{"type":"text","text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declare a property using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property wrapper and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specify the value’s key path. For example, you can read the current locale:"}],"title":"EnvironmentValues","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentValues"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismiss":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismiss","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","title":"dismiss","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An action that dismisses the current presentation.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismiss"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DismissAction"}]},"doc://Ope